On May 18, 2026, ChemoCentryx responded to Zydus' counterclaims and asserted its affirmative defenses.
On May 21, 2026, the U.S. District Court for the District of New Jersey entered an order consolidating the cases against Zydus and Annora for all purposes, including discovery, case management, and trial.
